Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,could baker mayfield
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,complete a single
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:04.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,pass against 11 umbrellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,except, last sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:06.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,he couldn't complete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,one against the falcons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:08.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero for three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:10.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,bucs still won.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,16 to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:13.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,team since 1974
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,to win without
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,a single completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:17.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,so baker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,gets a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,against umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,it's pouring in tampa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the umbrellas line up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,in a prevent defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,baker sends bucky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,irving in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,nobody follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:29.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,52 handoffs later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:32.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bucs lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,16 to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,at halftime, the broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,calls it the cleanest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,game of his career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero turnovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero completions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,baker finally drops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:43.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,every receiver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:44.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,is wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:45.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,he throws.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,an umbrella opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:47.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,interception.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:48.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,baker throws a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:49.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,block instead and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,lands in a puddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,even the referee slips.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:52.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,nobody follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score: bucs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:56.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,16, umbrellas zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:57.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,baker finishes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:00:59.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,the falcons immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:01.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,sign all 11 umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:02.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,finally, someone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:03.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,on their team
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:03.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,catches michael
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:05.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,penix jr.'s passes.
